                           STRING LIBRARY NOTES

1. Word functions are words and extwords. There is no insert, because a standard
insert can do that, but there are two issues with that. First, there is no
index function that can find the character position of a given word, so there is
no easy way to find the insert position. Second, use of a character insert would
not word normalize the string.

2. reads() needs a version that defaults to standard input.